{"conversation_id":"c136123e-929e-4502-8666-7c5078fdc576","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Root Cause\n\nIn [`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L6), the key generation helper was defined as:\n```python\ndef _key(spec):\n    return tuple(spec.items())\n```\nBecause dictionary iteration order depends on key insertion order, two dictionaries with identical keys and values inserted in different orders (such as `spec_a = {\"region\": \"eu\", \"tier\": \"gold\"}` and `spec_b = {\"tier\": \"gold\", \"region\": \"eu\"}`) produced different tuples (`(('region', 'eu'), ('tier', 'gold'))` vs. `(('tier', 'gold'), ('region', 'eu'))`). This caused cache misses and multiple entries for equivalent specifications in [`test_repeated_lookup`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/test_cache.py#L10-L20).\n\nAdditionally, [`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py) was missing the implementation of [`parse_duration`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py#L8-L28), which caused an `ImportError` during pytest collection of the test suite.\n\n---\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **[`pkg/cache.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/cache.py#L4-L5)**: Updated `_key` to sort dictionary items (`tuple(sorted(spec.items()))`), ensuring consistent cache keys regardless of dict insertion order.\n2. **[`pkg/parser.py`](file:///D:/Projects/subagents-mcp/bench/fixture_repo/pkg/parser.py#L8-L28)**: Implemented `parse_duration` to parse duration strings (`\"90s\"`, `\"5m\"`, `\"2h30m\"`) into seconds and raise `ValueError` for malformed strings.\n3. No test files were modified.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n\nRan `python -m pytest` and all 8 tests passed:\n```\n============================= test session starts =============================\nplatform win32 -- Python 3.13.7, pytest-9.1.1, pluggy-1.6.0\nrootdir: D:\\Projects\\subagents-mcp\\bench\\fixture_repo\ncollected 8 items\n\ntest_cache.py ..                                                         [ 25%]\ntest_parser.py ....                                                      [ 75%]\ntest_smoke.py ..                                                         [100%]\n\n============================== 8 passed in 0.05s ==============================\n```\n","duration_seconds":84.3517318,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":239972,"output_tokens":2649,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":303241,"total_tokens":242621}}
